sequenceDiagram
  participant W as Service worker
  participant C as Content script
  participant B as FastAPI backend
  participant N as Nova Lite
  W->>C: wait for DOM to settle
  C-->>W: snapshot with CSS selectors
  W->>B: POST task continue with history
  B->>N: screenshot, trimmed DOM, history
  N-->>B: one action with a copied selector
  B-->>W: action JSON
  W->>C: execute if verb is allowlisted
  C-->>W: result or FAILED text
  W->>W: append to history, stop on done or 25 steps
